#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:23 440992ce9b1748e78328a2b45b8a3cbe
msgid ""
"FmodAudioBus represents an audio mixing bus in the FMOD audio system. Each bus has its own "
"channel group for routing audio, and can have multiple audio effects applied to it."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioBus**    表示 FMOD 音频系统中的音频混音总线。每个总线都有自己的    ``FmodChannelGroup``    用于音频路由，并且可以应用多个    "
"``FmodAudioEffect``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:25 a66ddb60e47c4513a916a524c5d1207a
msgid ""
"Buses are organized in a hierarchy managed by "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`. The master bus is the root of this "
"hierarchy, with all other buses ultimately routing through it."
msgstr "总线由    :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`    管理的层级结构组织。主总线是该层级的根，所有其他总线最终通过它进行路由"

