#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:231 e93f9e740fdd486e8149d3131d55904e
msgid ""
"Returns the explicitly stored parent channel group. This cache may differ from native routing"
" after a layout synchronization. Query the channel group's "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup.get_parent_group()<class_FmodChannelGroup_method_get_parent_group>` "
"for its current native parent."
msgstr ""
"返回显式保存的父通道组。布局同步后，该缓存可能与原生路由不同。可通过通道组的  "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup.get_parent_group()<class_FmodChannelGroup_method_get_parent_group>`  "
"查询当前原生父级。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:255 0fb57d285db243ee92891b9da5d28f92
msgid ""
"Removes this bus's effects and clears its channel-group references. Releases the native "
"channel group for buses other than ``Master``."
msgstr "移除此总线的效果器并清除通道组引用。总线名称不是  ``Master``  时，还会释放原生通道组。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:267 de3d0197742e4d1cbaf1721f41be0248
msgid "Inserts ``effect`` into the stored effect list at ``index`` and applies it to this bus."
msgstr "将  ``effect``  插入保存的效果器列表中  ``index``  指定的位置，并应用到此总线。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:269 5f5cc66cebe34d789ff4d0dd74313259
msgid ""
"The list index is clamped between ``0`` and "
":ref:`get_effect_count()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_get_effect_count>`. It does not specify "
"the FMOD DSP insertion position."
msgstr ""
"列表索引会限制在  ``0``  到  :ref:`get_effect_count()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_get_effect_count>`  "
"之间，不用于指定 FMOD DSP 的插入位置。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:345 f3e69c56a0c0400c8e697e22bf856eb9
msgid ""
"Stores the user mute flag. Call :ref:`apply_mute()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_apply_mute>` to "
"apply it, or use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_mute>` to "
"update muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"保存用户静音标志。调用  :ref:`apply_mute()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_apply_mute>`  应用，或使用  "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_mute>`  "
"更新布局中的静音状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:357 fb364f7527b04d4383d1df55beb61c44
msgid "Returns the stored user mute flag. A bus can also be muted by another bus's solo state."
msgstr "返回保存的用户静音标志。其他总线的独奏状态也可能使此总线静音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:369 91cd9161b73e47ae939bdc8fc63cea40
msgid ""
"Applies the stored mute flag and solo state to the channel group. The ``mute`` argument means"
" that any bus in the layout is soloed; this bus is muted when that argument is ``true`` and "
"its own solo flag is ``false``."
msgstr "将保存的静音标志和独奏状态应用到通道组。\\  ``mute``  参数表示布局中存在独奏总线；此参数为  ``true``  且当前总线未独奏时，当前总线会被静音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:381 6412ec7551b74a9290db6f7864ff2c13
msgid ""
"Stores the solo flag. Use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>` to "
"also recompute muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"保存独奏标志。使用  "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>`  "
"可同时重新计算布局中的静音状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:405 56bac9aab001408b9f61b57e2af7b702
msgid ""
"Stores the bypass flag. Call :ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` to "
"apply it to the channel group's DSPs."
msgstr "保存旁路标志。调用  :ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>`  将其应用到通道组的 DSP。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:417 1a5a93a83a1c40f09aef70027bfac521
msgid ""
"Returns the stored bypass flag. :ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` "
"applies this flag to the channel group's DSPs."
msgstr "返回保存的旁路标志。\\  :ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>`  会将该标志应用到通道组的 DSP。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:429 2cb87c206e544c079618cf7bdf77ba57
msgid "Applies the stored bypass flag to every DSP currently in this bus's channel group."
msgstr "将保存的旁路标志应用到此总线通道组中的每个 DSP。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:393 0cfb9e09e131494a8754237ad69417bb
msgid ""
"Returns the stored solo flag, independently of the user mute flag. Use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>` to "
"apply solo muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"返回保存的独奏标志，不受用户静音标志影响。可通过  "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>`  "
"将独奏静音状态应用到整个布局。"
